WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.786
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.787
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.153
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.154
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.769 --> 01:14.817
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.776 --> 01:14.817
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.778 --> 01:30.698
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.617 --> 01:33.952
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.828 --> 01:35.871
Black Jack.

02:05.783 --> 02:10.662
I shall make you all into humanoids!

02:12.206 --> 02:13.373
Help!

02:13.374 --> 02:14.624
I'm scared!

02:17.461 --> 02:18.628
Hold it!

02:19.922 --> 02:21.548
The warrior of love and justice!

02:21.549 --> 02:23.508
Big Mask!

02:25.636 --> 02:27.971
Big Mask! Help us!

02:28.389 --> 02:30.974
Hyper Justice Kick!

02:33.894 --> 02:35.854
I'll get you back, Big Mask!

02:36.397 --> 02:38.189
The boss of the Monster Maker Group!

02:38.190 --> 02:40.233
I won't let you do whatever you want!

02:40.234 --> 02:41.317
I will fight!

02:41.318 --> 02:42.402
I will continue to fight!

02:42.403 --> 02:43.820
For the sake of the human race!

02:44.101 --> 02:45.006
There!

02:45.030 --> 02:46.761
Go for it, Big Mask!

02:46.948 --> 02:48.741
This is so stupid.

02:49.702 --> 02:51.286
You agree, don't you?

02:51.287 --> 02:53.288
Sharaku is excited about this sort of thing.

02:53.664 --> 02:55.248
Check this out!

02:55.499 --> 02:56.791
Isn't it great?

02:56.792 --> 03:00.170
I made friends with the Big Mask staff!

03:00.462 --> 03:02.213
One after the other,

03:02.214 --> 03:04.174
he collects all this weird stuff.

03:04.508 --> 03:05.585
That's so stupid.

03:05.759 --> 03:09.637
You're still a kid as long as you're
excited about these things.

03:11.265 --> 03:12.223
What's that?

03:12.474 --> 03:15.643
It's one of the humanoids that Boss made, called Gorass.

03:15.644 --> 03:18.188
He's really nasty.

03:20.524 --> 03:22.192
So cute!

03:23.277 --> 03:24.944
Let me see him!

03:24.945 --> 03:28.072
Please, lemme meet him!

03:28.073 --> 03:29.032
You mean Gorass?

03:29.033 --> 03:32.965
Please? Please? Pretty please?

03:33.370 --> 03:34.704
Fine then.

03:34.903 --> 03:36.950
Let me ask the staff.

03:37.124 --> 03:38.500
Yay!

03:38.501 --> 03:41.044
Gorass-chan, you're super cute!

03:41.045 --> 03:42.504
I'll come see you soon!

03:43.047 --> 03:46.132
Pinoco-chan, you have such unique tastes.

03:48.557 --> 03:51.629
Originally by Tezuka Osamu "Give My Brother Back!!"

03:48.557 --> 03:51.629
Give My Brother Back!

03:58.562 --> 03:59.521
I'm done.

04:00.356 --> 04:01.456
That was quick.

04:01.732 --> 04:04.493
I'm hurrying because I'm going out.

04:05.611 --> 04:06.569
Where are you going?

04:06.570 --> 04:08.944
To where they're filming Big Mask!

04:09.240 --> 04:11.282
You really like it.

04:11.439 --> 04:14.590
Because Gorass-chan is so cute!

04:14.828 --> 04:16.162
I'll be going now!

04:17.915 --> 04:21.417
Oh, and wash your own plate.

04:21.428 --> 04:22.160
Bye!

04:29.844 --> 04:32.053
Wash it yourself!

04:58.372 --> 05:00.498
It's the boss of the Monster Maker Group!

05:00.499 --> 05:04.085
Doesn't the Boss look kind of like Dr. Black Jack?

05:04.207 --> 05:05.207
Excuse me?

05:05.327 --> 05:06.894
Not at all.

05:07.756 --> 05:09.528
Please stand by!

05:09.767 --> 05:10.633
Yes.

05:11.135 --> 05:12.969
Filming is starting!

05:18.517 --> 05:20.185
Ah! Gorass-chan!

05:24.760 --> 05:26.149
Hey, here you are.

05:26.150 --> 05:28.568
I'm sorry about rushing in.

05:28.569 --> 05:29.330
It's okay.

05:31.488 --> 05:32.864
Weren't you with a friend?

05:42.041 --> 05:43.082
Cut! Cut!

05:43.918 --> 05:45.043
Pinoco-chan!

05:45.228 --> 05:46.465
Hey, Gorass-chan,

05:46.535 --> 05:48.248
come to my place.

05:48.408 --> 05:51.415
I'll treat you to a fine dinner.

05:51.967 --> 05:53.510
Someone get that kid off the set!

05:53.901 --> 05:55.457
Please?

05:54.941 --> 05:55.941
Hey, hey!

05:56.012 --> 05:57.805
Give me a minute, Director!

06:01.810 --> 06:04.395
Miss, it's not safe here, so you shouldn't come in.

06:05.349 --> 06:07.690
Ohmigewdness!

06:07.691 --> 06:10.193
Gorass-chan is a human?!

06:10.214 --> 06:11.987
"To Pinoco-chan"

06:12.696 --> 06:13.988
Pinoco-chan,

06:13.989 --> 06:17.116
that's only a TV set, not a real story.

06:17.409 --> 06:19.494
Didn't you even know that?

06:19.495 --> 06:22.705
Gorass-chan in that costume was cute,

06:22.706 --> 06:26.334
but the man inside was kind, and even nicer.

06:26.752 --> 06:29.170
I was really embarrassed.

06:29.797 --> 06:31.714
Did you just say something?

06:31.715 --> 06:34.092
It's nothing.

06:37.638 --> 06:39.704
You're good with small kids.

06:40.015 --> 06:42.126
Maybe because I have a much younger brother.

06:42.351 --> 06:44.310
I can't help it when I see small kids.

06:49.024 --> 06:50.024
What's wrong?

06:50.025 --> 06:50.984
My legs...

06:52.236 --> 06:54.022
They're really swollen.

06:54.282 --> 06:56.155
They are getting worse.

06:56.657 --> 06:58.741
Maybe you should see a doctor.

06:59.243 --> 06:59.993
Yeah...

07:00.619 --> 07:05.832
Hey, l think that Sharaku kid knows
an incredible doctor, Black Jack,

07:05.833 --> 07:06.958
so let's get referred to him.

07:07.543 --> 07:09.377
Yeah, please.

07:14.508 --> 07:16.885
Big Mask is so cool.

07:17.344 --> 07:18.790
I have them too!

07:18.916 --> 07:21.848
Big Mask is so strong!

07:23.058 --> 07:26.644
Here's Gorass that the boss of the
Monster Maker Group made.

07:26.979 --> 07:28.688
I hate him.

07:28.689 --> 07:29.856
I know.

07:30.441 --> 07:31.575
Hey, Yukio,

07:31.775 --> 07:33.985
Gorass is your big brother, right?

07:34.361 --> 07:35.236
Seriously?!

07:35.237 --> 07:38.114
So your big brother is a bad guy.

07:38.574 --> 07:39.490
No, he's not!

07:39.491 --> 07:40.687
Nii-chan is kind,

07:40.687 --> 07:41.993
and not a bad guy!

07:42.494 --> 07:44.787
Everyone hates him!

07:44.788 --> 07:45.955
No!

07:45.956 --> 07:47.957
Nobody hates him!

07:48.459 --> 07:52.879
Bad guys like this should be...

07:54.548 --> 07:55.381
Now you've done it!

07:57.718 --> 08:00.553
I won't forgive anyone who insults Nii-chan!

08:00.971 --> 08:02.138
Oh, come on!

08:02.139 --> 08:03.097
Get him back!

08:03.807 --> 08:05.350
Ouch!

08:17.780 --> 08:19.239
What are you doing, Yukio?

08:20.032 --> 08:20.823
Nii-chan.

08:22.701 --> 08:24.786
What, did you have a fight?

08:25.829 --> 08:28.998
Why are you the humanoid Gorass?

08:29.416 --> 08:31.709
Why do you have to play the bad guy?

08:33.128 --> 08:34.757
I hate you, Nii-chan!

08:35.070 --> 08:36.434
Stupid! Stupid!

08:36.674 --> 08:38.132
You're stupid!

08:38.801 --> 08:39.676
Yukio!

08:42.054 --> 08:43.304
Yukio...

08:44.431 --> 08:45.765
That's why?

08:46.475 --> 08:50.972
I heard he had a big fight a with some
kids who insulted Gorass.

08:51.647 --> 08:54.107
I see, that's why...

08:55.025 --> 08:57.527
By the way, how are your legs?

08:57.528 --> 08:59.668
Shouldn't you see a doctor?

08:59.864 --> 09:02.240
Yeah, I heard about a good doctor,

09:02.241 --> 09:03.366
so I'll go see him now.

09:05.786 --> 09:06.870
I'm home.

09:08.789 --> 09:09.789
Where is Nii-chan?

09:10.416 --> 09:11.583
He went to a clinic.

09:12.084 --> 09:12.876
Clinic?

09:13.711 --> 09:15.211
Is something wrong with him?

09:16.172 --> 09:17.557
It's something with his legs.

09:17.882 --> 09:19.446
But there's nothing to worry about.

09:20.174 --> 09:21.174
I see.

09:22.469 --> 09:24.387
<i>I wanted to apologize to him...</i>

09:32.605 --> 09:34.856
Sharaku, what are you doing?

09:35.816 --> 09:37.025
Pinoco-chan,

09:37.026 --> 09:39.277
you'll be shocked when you go inside.

09:42.406 --> 09:44.282
Ohmigewdness!

09:48.037 --> 09:49.370
Hey, you are...

09:49.914 --> 09:51.289
Hey, Gorass guy,

09:51.290 --> 09:53.013
why are you here?

09:53.417 --> 09:55.293
Did you come to see me?

09:55.961 --> 09:57.382
He's a patient.

09:57.630 --> 10:00.230
He'll be staying here a while for an examination.

10:00.591 --> 10:01.799
Treat me well.

10:01.800 --> 10:02.258
Thank you.

10:04.162 --> 10:05.162
I...

10:05.513 --> 10:07.472
I'll cook my best!

10:11.852 --> 10:12.810
I'm home.

10:13.312 --> 10:14.312
Welcome back.

10:16.899 --> 10:18.848
Nii-chan isn't back yet?

10:19.026 --> 10:22.362
He said he couldn't come home for
a while because of the exam.

10:22.363 --> 10:23.655
How boring.

10:30.079 --> 10:31.621
Is your mother home?

10:32.915 --> 10:34.290
<i>Who is he?</i>

10:34.583 --> 10:35.750
I'm coming in.

10:44.134 --> 10:47.452
<i>That scar on his face looks like the one on
the Boss of the Monster Maker Group.</i>

10:47.805 --> 10:49.973
<i>He must be a bad guy.</i>

10:51.016 --> 10:53.810
I will keep your son.

10:54.603 --> 10:55.520
<i>Your son?</i>

10:56.230 --> 10:57.397
<i>Nii-chan?!</i>

10:58.315 --> 11:00.692
I may cut him.

11:03.362 --> 11:05.113
The operation will cost you 20,000,000!

11:06.073 --> 11:07.365
20,000,000?!

11:08.325 --> 11:10.535
Call this number when you have the money.

11:12.204 --> 11:13.204
<i>Oh, no!</i>

11:13.205 --> 11:15.039
<i>Nii-chan must've been captured by him!</i>

11:18.460 --> 11:22.038
Mom! He's the boss of the Monster Maker Group!

11:22.339 --> 11:24.343
Don't be so stupid.

11:24.550 --> 11:27.468
He's a doctor named Black Jack.

11:28.095 --> 11:29.179
That's a lie!

11:29.180 --> 11:30.471
Unless you give him money,

11:30.472 --> 11:33.474
he's going to make Nii-chan into a humanoid!

11:34.476 --> 11:36.895
Go play over there, son.

11:37.396 --> 11:38.771
Mom, you're stupid!

11:38.772 --> 11:40.940
You don't care what happens to Nii-chan!

11:50.618 --> 11:51.326
This is it.

11:52.125 --> 11:53.396
Wait for me, Nii-chan!

11:53.579 --> 11:55.455
I'll come save, you!

12:18.853 --> 12:20.646
It's like a haunted house.

12:21.523 --> 12:23.482
But I must save Nii-chan.

12:23.900 --> 12:24.483
Here I go!

12:39.672 --> 12:40.631
There's the Boss.

12:40.632 --> 12:42.382
I must not be caught.

13:00.193 --> 13:01.735
This is the operating room.

13:02.487 --> 13:05.114
He must be making the humanoids here.

13:10.411 --> 13:11.203
Come in.

13:12.580 --> 13:13.622
Dinner is ready.

13:14.290 --> 13:15.666
I'm sorry.

13:15.667 --> 13:17.376
Isn't it inconvenient with the power outage?

13:17.919 --> 13:18.582
It's okay.

13:18.795 --> 13:20.337
All I do is sleep anyway.

13:20.755 --> 13:21.672
Here you go.

13:21.673 --> 13:24.091
It's special today.

13:24.342 --> 13:25.968
Eat a lot.

13:28.972 --> 13:30.848
Nii-chan is in there.

13:39.774 --> 13:41.859
Nii-chan, I'm here to save you.

13:51.286 --> 13:52.744
Yukio!

13:55.248 --> 13:58.375
I'm serving spaghetti too!

14:04.090 --> 14:06.592
How could this be...

14:15.435 --> 14:16.745
What was that?

14:16.936 --> 14:18.429
That was my brother.

14:18.688 --> 14:19.229
Your brother?

14:20.815 --> 14:23.150
I need to make it again.

14:33.870 --> 14:35.078
Nii-chan is...

14:35.538 --> 14:39.041
Nii-chan was made into a humanoid!

14:39.042 --> 14:40.501
My Nii-chan!

14:45.924 --> 14:48.890
Oh, Yukio just came home.

14:50.136 --> 14:51.714
Came to see you?

15:00.939 --> 15:02.516
So, how is Yukio-kun?

15:02.899 --> 15:05.283
He went straight to bed as soon as he got home.

15:05.568 --> 15:10.864
He's mumbling that "Nii-chan was made
into a humanoid" in his sleep.

15:11.449 --> 15:14.184
Your appearance must have scared him.

15:14.327 --> 15:15.369
Yes.

15:17.411 --> 15:22.209
Oh, man, how can,I clear up this misunderstanding?

15:33.346 --> 15:34.179
Doc...

15:36.683 --> 15:37.599
What, Pinoco?

15:37.600 --> 15:38.851
You haven't gone to bed yet?

15:39.561 --> 15:41.895
Can I ask-you for a favor?

15:47.402 --> 15:49.778
Your son has lumphatic filariasis,

15:49.779 --> 15:52.364
a rare disease in which the lymphatic tube is clogged.

15:53.199 --> 15:57.492
The tight costume worn around the legs might have
accelerated the intensity of the symptoms.

15:57.954 --> 16:02.212
About the operation fee, I can get 10,000,000...

16:02.417 --> 16:04.751
Mom, that's so much...

16:05.545 --> 16:08.547
That's the best I can do with all of my savings.

16:09.048 --> 16:11.550
Doctor, can we do something about it?

16:12.427 --> 16:14.595
I said 20,000,000.

16:15.388 --> 16:16.388
If you can't pay that,

16:16.389 --> 16:17.264
then I can't operate on him.

16:17.807 --> 16:18.974
We don't have that much!

16:29.110 --> 16:30.402
Okay, doctor.

16:30.862 --> 16:32.268
I'll see other doctors.

16:32.470 --> 16:34.364
Thank you for everything.

16:39.579 --> 16:40.454
Wait.

16:41.498 --> 16:44.082
There is someone who is eager to operate on you.

16:45.376 --> 16:46.293
Who is that?

16:52.717 --> 16:53.801
It's Dr. Pinoco.

16:56.971 --> 17:00.641
I'll take the Gorass costume as payment.

17:08.900 --> 17:11.819
This will sting you a bit.

17:13.738 --> 17:15.239
Are you serious?!

17:15.240 --> 17:16.740
Of course.

17:17.283 --> 17:18.932
Enough of this joke!

17:19.536 --> 17:21.120
Ready?!

17:29.170 --> 17:31.922
Doc, I guess we don't need any anesthetic.

17:34.634 --> 17:36.552
Ohmigewdness...

17:42.767 --> 17:45.644
Thank you so much, Doctor.

17:45.645 --> 17:48.178
Actually, thank Pinoco.

17:48.398 --> 17:49.982
Thank you, Pinoco-chan.

17:50.567 --> 17:53.110
Anything for my Gorass guy.

17:53.736 --> 17:56.432
Anyway, what do we do with Yukio?

17:56.656 --> 18:00.409
He still thinks his brother has
been turned into a humanoid.

18:00.410 --> 18:01.827
Oh, man...

18:01.828 --> 18:06.039
Only bitter memories will stick
with him if I just go home now.

18:07.083 --> 18:09.543
I have a good idea.

18:16.009 --> 18:16.925
Nii-chan...

18:26.060 --> 18:31.774
I'm the Monster Maker Group's Boss's follower, a humanoid!

18:34.652 --> 18:37.738
I'm here to deliver a letter from the Boss.

18:39.561 --> 18:41.342
There it is!

18:43.161 --> 18:44.036
He disappeared!

18:44.037 --> 18:45.245
He's been transported!

18:45.622 --> 18:47.936
No, we haven't.

18:48.249 --> 18:49.208
Sighhh...

18:50.710 --> 18:53.170
<i>If you want your brother back,</i>

18:53.171 --> 18:55.547
<i>come to the Monster Maker Group's hideout.</i>

18:56.007 --> 18:57.549
<i>If you tell anyone about this,</i>

18:57.550 --> 18:59.134
<i>we will kill your brother.</i>

19:17.195 --> 19:19.655
Come out, Boss of the Monster Makers!

19:23.159 --> 19:24.451
I am right here.

19:24.828 --> 19:26.912
I'm here!

19:26.913 --> 19:29.373
Grrrrrr!

19:32.544 --> 19:34.294
Make Nii-chan back to normal!

19:37.549 --> 19:39.299
Let me go!

19:41.219 --> 19:41.927
Wait!

19:42.554 --> 19:43.220
Nii-chan!

19:44.597 --> 19:46.557
Yukio, I'm fine!

19:47.016 --> 19:51.895
I was only pretending that I was modified to trick the Boss!

19:52.480 --> 19:55.107
So you're still human!?

19:55.567 --> 19:56.233
Yes!

19:56.693 --> 19:57.860
Look!

19:58.445 --> 19:59.069
Here I go!

20:08.746 --> 20:12.291
Super Justice Kick!

20:15.962 --> 20:16.920
You got me...

20:17.338 --> 20:18.756
Yeah!

20:22.552 --> 20:24.775
There are too many great enemies on Earth.

20:25.180 --> 20:26.930
I will leave this planet.

20:32.729 --> 20:34.021
Nii-chan!

20:34.939 --> 20:36.133
It's all okay now.

20:36.399 --> 20:38.150
The Monster Maker Group is gone.

20:38.651 --> 20:40.628
You're really strong!

20:40.862 --> 20:43.614
You're the hero who saved the human race!

20:44.115 --> 20:47.659
I'm sorry about making you worry, Yukio.

20:51.661 --> 20:53.832
It went well.

20:53.833 --> 20:56.126
Sheesh, why do I have to do this?

20:57.420 --> 20:59.379
But it was fun.

20:59.756 --> 21:02.007
Wasn't my act pretty good?

21:02.217 --> 21:05.260
It's not easy being a monster.

21:05.261 --> 21:08.347
I envy you, Doc, since you don't need any makeup.

21:16.064 --> 21:18.982
Really, I'm serious!

21:18.983 --> 21:19.983
No way!

21:19.984 --> 21:23.112
It was so funny.

21:24.114 --> 21:26.616
I wanted to see that.

21:25.573 --> 21:27.199
Aren't you jealous?

21:31.079 --> 21:32.162
You are...

21:32.497 --> 21:37.447
Oh, uh, we decided to stay on Earth.

21:37.447 --> 21:40.087
But we won't do anything bad anymore.

21:41.214 --> 21:42.967
You're still talking sabout that?

21:43.716 --> 21:46.051
Those are just stories on TV.

21:46.928 --> 21:49.555
You'd better grow up soon.

22:07.080 --> 22:19.035
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.080 --> 22:19.035
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.153 --> 22:24.152
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.153 --> 22:24.152
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.721 --> 22:31.190
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.721 --> 22:31.190
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.734 --> 22:37.192
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.734 --> 22:37.192
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.796 --> 22:40.281
being heated up by you,

22:37.796 --> 22:40.281
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.490 --> 22:48.267
so much that I change color

22:40.490 --> 22:48.267
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.352 --> 23:00.121
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.352 --> 23:00.121
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.329 --> 23:12.060
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.329 --> 23:12.060
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.300 --> 23:23.651
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.300 --> 23:23.651
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

